            0.278
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Q.1. At what number is ‘idli-vada’ said for the 10th time?",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.117,
            0.287,
            0.22,
            0.305
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Ans. 150."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.314,
            0.689,
            0.333
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Q.2. If the game is played for the numbers from 1 till 90, find out:",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.162,
            0.342,
            0.881,
            0.378
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "a. How many times would the children say ‘idli’ (including the times they say ‘idlivada’)?",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.117,
            0.387,
            0.258,
            0.404
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Ans. 30 times."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.162,
            0.414,
            0.881,
            0.449
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "b. How many times would the children say ‘vada’ (including the times they say ‘idlivada’)?",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 12,
          "bbox": [
            0.117,
            0.459,
            0.258,
            0.477
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Ans. 18 times."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 13,
          "bbox": [
            0.163,
            0.486,
            0.639,
            0.504
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "c. How many times would the children say ‘idli-vada’?",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 14,
          "bbox": [
            0.117,
            0.514,
            0.248,
            0.531
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Ans. 6 times."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 15,
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.54,
            0.785,
            0.559
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Q.3. What if the game was played till 900? How would your answers change?",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 16,
          "bbox": [
            0.116,
            0.567,
            0.881,
            0.604
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Ans. If the game was played till 900, idli-vada would be said 60 times by the children. ‘Vada’ will be said 180 time and ‘idli’ will be said 300 times."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 17,
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.612,
            0.881,
            0.649
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Q.4. Is this figure somehow related to the ‘idli-vada’ game? Hint: Imagine playing the game till 30. Draw the figure if the game is played till 60.",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 18,
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.658,
            0.779,
            0.676
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Ans. Yes, the common numbers represent the numbers when to say ‘idli-vada’."
            }
          ]
        },
